## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to reason about multi-region data residency, cross-region replication, and exactly-once guarantees in a real system with tenants spanning regions. It also probes conflict resolution during migrations and the design of robust observability and rollout strategies.

## Key Concepts

- Region-aware routing and sticky tenancy
- Per-tenant quotas and data residency guarantees
- Cross-region replication with idempotent merges and sequence numbers
- Migration handling and offset rehoming
- Canary rollout, rollback, and tenant-level observability

## Code Example

